**Choices I made**

- Named the library `engine_scene` and put it in `engine/scene/`, following the PRD's project layout. Reflection doesn't depend on the ECS, so it links only `engine_core`.
- Defaults are not compared with the C++ member initializers. A descriptor can disagree with `T{}`, and I documented that.
- FR-13 (schema rejection of unsupported formats) is only partly covered. The descriptor carries the schema version. Rejecting unsupported saved formats belongs to US-017.

